Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.07,0:01:18.74,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1245.284,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}時
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:00.50,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,--13--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.69,0:01:21.45,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(896.604,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}目
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.74,0:01:21.50,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}送
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.79,0:01:21.55,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1023.396,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}著
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:00.50,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,--14--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.86,0:01:24.59,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(896.604,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}揮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.91,0:01:24.64,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}著
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.96,0:01:24.69,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1023.396,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:00.50,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,--15--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:28.97,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(833.208,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.29,0:01:29.02,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(896.604,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.34,0:01:29.07,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}太
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.39,0:01:29.12,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1023.396,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.44,0:01:29.17,OP_CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1086.792,1026)}{\fad(90,90)}了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.09,0:21:28.08,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}裾が濡れたなら　乾くの待てばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.13,0:21:35.30,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}水音をたてて跳ねた
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:43.61,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}きみが教えてくれたんだ　もう恐くない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:55.52,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}握っていてくれたこの手を離さなきゃだめだ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.74,0:22:07.45,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ひとりでもゆくよ　例え辛くても
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.61,0:22:15.65,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんなで見た夢は　必ず持ってくよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.65,0:22:23.67,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんなとがいいな　みんなとがよかった
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.67,0:22:31.98,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}でも目覚めた朝　誰も居ないんだね
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:56.22,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}もう振り返っても誰の影もない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:23:02.35,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}水たまりだけが光った
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.73,0:23:11.64,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}生きてくことそれは立ち向かっていくこと
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:23.70,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}それがわかったなら後は踏み出す勇気だけ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.71,0:23:35.53,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}どこまでもゆくよ　ここで知ったこと
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.53,0:23:43.56,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}幸せという夢を叶えてみせるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.56,0:23:51.54,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんなと離れても　どんなに遠くなっても
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:59.56,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}新しい朝に　この僕は生きるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:07.54,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}巡って流れて　時は移ろいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.54,0:24:15.63,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}もう何があったか　思い出せないけど
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.63,0:24:23.57,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}目を閉じてみれば　みんなの笑い声
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.57,0:24:32.69,EDJP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fs54}なぜかそれが今一番の宝物
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.09,0:21:28.08,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}風雨過後的道路 已不再泥濘
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.13,0:21:35.30,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}點點水珠映出了一條彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:43.61,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}是你教會了我 不要再去害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.61,0:21:55.52,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}無論如何不能再去依靠 那雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.74,0:22:07.45,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}孤身一人也要前行 哪怕前方遍佈荊棘
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.61,0:22:15.65,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}定會帶著大家的那個夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.65,0:22:23.67,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}茫茫眾生中大家相遇  如此幸運
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.67,0:22:31.98,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}然而夢醒時分卻發現  空無一人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:56.22,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}即使回頭望去 也沒了大家的蹤影
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:23:02.35,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}只剩那空寂的校園如舊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.73,0:23:11.64,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}人生旅途要面對無數的困難
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.64,0:23:23.70,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}如果準備好了 那就拿出勇氣啟程吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.71,0:23:35.53,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}這段故事伴我前行 無論天涯和海角
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.53,0:23:43.56,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}定會實現那個幸福的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.56,0:23:51.54,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}哪怕與大家分開 就算海天相隔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.54,0:23:59.56,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我也將迎接那嶄新的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.56,0:24:07.54,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}時光轉逝 歲月變遷
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.54,0:24:15.63,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}雖已把曾經的故事遺忘
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.63,0:24:23.57,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}但只要一閉上眼 就會聽到大家的笑聲
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.57,0:24:32.69,EDCN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\an2\fs60}不知為何 這是如今最珍貴的寶物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}從晴空萬里的死後世界
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}向您推薦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.69,0:07:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}只需隨意按幾個號碼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.82,0:07:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}死之前一定要嘗一嘗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.15,0:07:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}麻婆豆腐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.96,0:07:36.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}啊啊  麻婆豆腐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}麻婆豆腐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.57,0:13:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}老師的恩情  我永世難忘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:14.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}校園的景色  已印在心中
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.31,0:13:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}回首看去  真是時光如梭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.19,0:13:39.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}臨別之際  互道一…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.30,0:13:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一聲珍重
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:46.52,upup,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(450,270)}畢業證書
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:46.52,upup,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(360,450)}仲村百合同學\N\N茲證明你在本校為\N大家一直努力至今
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.78,0:09:46.52,upup,NTP,0,0,0,,{\frz-90\pos(120,525)\fs48}死後世界戰線
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:34.84,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an2\fscy110\fad(1000,0)}三天之後
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.01,0:01:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:01:56.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.74,0:01:58.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保健室
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.27,0:02:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保健室？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們為什麼還在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.77,0:02:05.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要勉強自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.30,0:02:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒事的  小奏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.59,0:02:11.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這次對小百合你來說 可真不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.81,0:02:14.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虧你這樣 還能擔任戰線的領袖到今天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連你們也都還在…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.02,0:02:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們還留在這裡幹什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,影子不是已經消失了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.11,0:02:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼就不會再有東西妨礙你們了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.59,0:02:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我們知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.42,0:02:26.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.63,0:02:28.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你還留在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還留在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.69,0:02:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.03,0:02:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.73,0:02:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該說什麼好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.85,0:02:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.08,0:02:41.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不太確定…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.97,0:02:44.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜百合所背負的糾葛或許已經解開了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.47,0:02:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎  百合
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.10,0:01:31.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:53.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個  那個是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.01,0:02:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  就讓我用催眠術來讓你坦白吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.31,0:02:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少給我管閒事！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從這抗拒的態度來看…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.27,0:03:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說中了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.35,0:03:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…  沒有這樣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.59,0:03:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是領袖呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:09.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼容易就解開豈不惹人笑話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:12.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  就讓我用催眠術…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.82,0:03:13.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  就是解開了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.05,0:03:15.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意見嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  承認了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來小奏這麼壞心眼啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因為百合太調皮了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還真能說
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.90,0:03:31.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過  我還真有點高興
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.94,0:03:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:34.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你能叫我百合
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.41,0:03:36.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.54,0:03:39.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為  這不就像是朋友一樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.26,0:03:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.67,0:03:43.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.99,0:03:46.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼一來  我們的準備就不是白費力氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.62,0:03:47.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:48.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.93,0:03:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要做什麼事情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後有件想做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:55.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奏說她還沒試過呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？  是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:02.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:03.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都走了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.19,0:04:05.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎  太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.41,0:04:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全靠大家的幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.59,0:04:09.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然也花了不少力氣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  那是神才做得到的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然嘴上諸多抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.24,0:04:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但大家其實都挺喜歡這裡的生活呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.39,0:04:19.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我總算是明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.99,0:04:22.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也是托小百合的福呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:22.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了  高松也走掉了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:28.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然變成NPC但後來恢復了意識
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.78,0:04:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦  這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.79,0:04:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看起來不太吃驚嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:35.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是說變成NPC以後就不能恢復過來了的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來是憑藉堅強的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就總有一天能恢復成人的設定啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.95,0:04:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是哪首歌來著
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才做準備時也一直在哼著
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.02,0:04:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什麼來著
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:53.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那首吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.35,0:04:56.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,岩澤同學最後唱的那首歌
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.14,0:04:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「My  Song」
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:05:00.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對  是那首歌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:04.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通過全校廣播放的那首吧  真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.81,0:05:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是一首好歌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:06.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:10.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,體育館？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:18.27,up,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}死後世界戰線  畢業典禮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們幾個人做的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.19,0:05:23.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,題字的是奏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.73,0:05:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小奏  原來沒參加過畢業典禮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想也許會挺有趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.24,0:05:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點也不有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過寫字的時候看上去挺高興的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.30,0:05:38.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女生沒幾個是不哭的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.65,0:05:40.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  所以說女人真麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:47.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以為我們是為什麼才換上這身衣服的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:48.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.95,0:05:50.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是在想真的會消失嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:52.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還沒做好心理準備
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:55.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊  這樣也算是原戰線的領袖嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.11,0:05:56.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.38,0:06:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總覺得自從大家消失之後  你就沒了領袖的樣子了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.64,0:06:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼一說還真有點變了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.38,0:06:06.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.41,0:06:08.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎更像一個女孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.81,0:06:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我應該高興  還是生氣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.02,0:06:20.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥結束後 就變回連這種事都不知道的純真女孩了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.68,0:06:22.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小百合也有可愛的地方嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.47,0:06:26.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋  笨蛋  笨蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:26.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.31,0:06:29.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,百合真有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.73,0:06:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:34.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會前致辭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現開始舉行一直在死後世界作戰至今的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.67,0:06:41.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死後世界戰線的畢業典禮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.23,0:06:45.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先  齊唱戰歌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:47.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰歌!?  那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.50,0:06:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死後世界戰線的歌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:52.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就當作是代替校歌的東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.97,0:06:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不記得讓人編過這種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.05,0:06:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這歌也是奏編的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:06:58.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你編的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話說你根本不是戰線成員吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:02.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  把歌詞發給大家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:06.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曲調怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.31,0:07:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,校歌不都差不多嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:11.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨便唱一下就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.31,0:07:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,預備
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:43.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這歌詞是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰事先檢查一下呀  居然就直接唱了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:49.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了吧  小奏她也是花了不少心思才寫出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.99,0:07:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣說嘛  對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.39,0:07:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用心？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.06,0:07:57.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡不是寫明了「隨意」嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.97,0:07:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是該怎麼說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.57,0:08:02.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歌詞裡充滿了奏的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.23,0:08:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:06.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從頭至尾全部
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.03,0:08:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了呢  小奏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:13.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.57,0:08:15.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:16.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,頒發畢業證書
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有那種東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.26,0:08:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特地做了的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.97,0:08:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然大部分又是讓奏做的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.86,0:08:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼頒發證書的校長呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  我猜拳就是輸掉了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:38.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.42,0:08:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彷彿就是為你量身定制的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.39,0:08:42.17,up,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  為什麼總是我幹這種苦差事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.47,0:08:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,頒發畢業證書
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立華奏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來  仲村百合
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.45,0:09:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:37.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這打扮很適合你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.65,0:09:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要你管
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.43,0:09:47.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.95,0:09:52.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來  直井文人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:09:57.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讚頌我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.41,0:09:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.17,0:10:00.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:03.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝你所做的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:06.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音無結弦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.46,0:10:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.39,0:10:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那個摘下來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.45,0:10:16.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  那…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日向秀樹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:21.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:24.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛  真是服了你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:30.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是  受了你很多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.83,0:10:45.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢業生代表  致辭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.68,0:10:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回首過去  發生了許多事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:58.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這個學校  我最先遇到的人是仲村百合同學
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.99,0:11:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然就被告知自己已經死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.96,0:11:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,並且得知留在這個死後世界的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.09,0:11:12.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都是不願接受自己生前的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:14.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對神做出反抗的人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.33,0:11:17.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也作為其中的一員戰鬥過
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:22.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我通過取回自己所失去的記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:25.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接受了自己的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:28.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一份不可代替的回憶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:33.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,於是我開始希望大家也能感受到同樣的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.35,0:11:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都是一直抗爭至今的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是件非常困難的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.03,0:11:47.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他們能夠互相幫助  互相信任
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.66,0:11:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以仲村百合同學為中心組成的戰線
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.99,0:11:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這樣的一群人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.82,0:11:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將這份力量化為勇氣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:02.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家漸漸開始接受了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.73,0:12:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後大家都積極向前…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.26,0:12:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離開了這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:14.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留在這裡的五人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:16.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也將在今天畢業
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使忘記了一路走來的夥伴們的長相
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不會忘記這深刻在靈魂裡的羈絆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.45,0:12:29.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能和大家一起度過這段時光
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.26,0:12:31.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:33.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太感謝你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.56,0:12:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢業生代表  音無結弦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:42.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全體起立
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.27,0:12:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,齊唱「難忘您  恩師」
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:40.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唱慢了  你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.19,0:13:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼  明顯是你唱快了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.11,0:13:45.72,up,NTP,0,0,0,,是你太慢的緣故吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.46,0:13:48.95,up,NTP,0,0,0,,對我和對音無就是不一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.38,0:13:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們唱得倒挺合拍的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.94,0:13:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,預備
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.67,0:14:14.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉幕致辭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:19.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至此  死後世界戰線的畢業典禮正式閉幕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:22.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢業生  退場
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.23,0:14:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想看到女人哭成一片
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先走一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哭的人是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.73,0:14:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音無大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果沒有遇見音無大哥的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.07,0:14:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:52.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概永遠都得不到解脫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.48,0:14:56.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.35,0:14:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會再迷茫了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.77,0:15:02.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:05.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.56,0:15:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝…你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.03,0:15:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.41,0:15:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  接下來該誰哭呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.42,0:15:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰會哭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:25.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小奏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.27,0:15:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直在和你爭鬥  真對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.77,0:15:32.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼沒能早點成為朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.14,0:15:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:37.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.85,0:15:39.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我啊  是長女
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.19,0:15:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直代替父母照顧頑皮的弟弟妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.35,0:15:48.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以一定能教給小奏很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:51.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小奏看起來是那麼不知世故
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.22,0:15:53.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我特別擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:57.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明能為你做好多事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:16:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做好多事  一起玩耍
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.61,0:16:05.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是  要是有更多一點的時間該多好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.12,0:16:09.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該說再見了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:12.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見  小奏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.99,0:16:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.67,0:16:29.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:30.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.04,0:16:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你了  百合
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:34.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝你那麼多關照
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.99,0:16:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,頭兒  辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.44,0:16:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:40.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼  有緣再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.91,0:16:48.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來輪到我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.50,0:16:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照順序來看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我先走也可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.36,0:16:53.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.80,0:16:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可別扔下小奏一個人自己先走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.54,0:16:59.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.57,0:17:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.57,0:17:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.49,0:17:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有你的話什麼都不會開始
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:09.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不會迎來這樣的結局
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.85,0:17:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:12.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是碰巧而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仔細一想的話  我本不應該來這裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.53,0:17:23.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在死之前已經度過了一個釋然的人生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:25.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為那段記憶被封閉了起來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.34,0:17:27.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才誤入了這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為想起了那段記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:33.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才能在這個世界裡體會到釋然的人生的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.05,0:17:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.37,0:17:40.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還真是個特別的存在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.12,0:17:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以能幫到大家也是多虧了這種碰巧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.20,0:17:47.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:50.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說得太久也不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.27,0:17:53.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.91,0:17:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.99,0:17:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果遇到了唯  也幫我向她打個招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.28,0:18:00.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然 反正好運氣都留著呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:02.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可要好好抓住機會呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.61,0:18:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了  摯友
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢業典禮感覺怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.92,0:18:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.43,0:18:28.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  很開心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但在最後很寂寞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.98,0:18:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過這可是一個新的啟程啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:37.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都向著新的人生出發了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:39.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是好事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:41.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.88,0:18:49.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說  到外面去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.91,0:18:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想稍微吹一下風
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.89,0:18:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:09.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說  奏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.17,0:19:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不一直留在這裡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:17.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然想到的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.33,0:19:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為還會有像百合和日向他們那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.11,0:19:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人生沒有得到釋然的人到這裡來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.75,0:19:27.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:32.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們說不定又會像百合他們一樣留在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.18,0:19:37.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這裡一直痛苦著  不停地反抗著人生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.29,0:19:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.74,0:19:40.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.21,0:19:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我們留下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.40,0:19:48.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以像這次一樣  把人生的美好傳達給他們
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:50.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以讓他們從這裡畢業
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.07,0:19:56.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定我就是因為這個使命而來到這裡的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:19:57.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.97,0:20:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能和我一起留下來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和奏在一起的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.33,0:20:07.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使是在這樣的世界裡  我也不會感到寂寞的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.10,0:20:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前也說過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.37,0:20:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.59,0:20:14.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今後也想和你一直都在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.18,0:20:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.37,0:20:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.39,0:20:23.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡奏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.50,0:20:27.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:35.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你一句話也不說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:37.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.95,0:20:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我要是把現在的想法說出來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.08,0:20:45.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就會消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.42,0:20:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.29,0:20:53.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我是來向你說聲「謝謝」的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.10,0:20:55.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.51,0:21:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我是靠你的心臟才活下來的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:10.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在我的身體裡  你的心臟在跳動著
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:13.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我唯一的不幸就是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.72,0:21:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒能對賜予我青春的恩人說聲謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.22,0:21:21.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是為了這句謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.16,0:21:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是為了這個心願
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:25.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才誤入了這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.88,0:21:27.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.86,0:21:31.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你為什麼會知道是我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.07,0:21:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在一開始的那一刺時  我察覺到的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:37.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒有心臟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.36,0:21:41.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 只憑這一點…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.25,0:21:45.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你之所以能取回自己的記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為你在我的胸口上做了夢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.19,0:21:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因為一直在聽著自己心臟跳動的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:54.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.68,0:22:03.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結弦  拜託你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.01,0:22:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的那番話請再說一次
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.04,0:22:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.20,0:22:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奏…會消失的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.80,0:22:17.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結弦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.52,0:22:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.91,0:22:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事  我辦不到
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.88,0:22:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結弦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.30,0:22:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也請讓我相信  你一直以來所相信的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.10,0:22:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「活著是件很美好的事」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.38,0:22:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結弦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.05,0:22:48.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.81,0:22:50.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愛你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.46,0:22:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永遠都和我在一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.39,0:22:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  謝謝你  結弦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.75,0:23:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永遠  永遠都在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.21,0:23:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.03,0:23:04.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愛你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.52,0:23:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.03,0:23:09.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  真是太感謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.33,0:23:11.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.66,0:23:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你能愛我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.41,0:23:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要消失啊  奏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:22.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奏
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.55,0:23:24.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,賜予我生命
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.91,0:23:29.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的…很感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.85,0:23:50.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,2000)}奏！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,
